# PLAN.md — QR Pager SaaS

> DELIBERATELY BAD. Rule 8's fixture for clause (a): a second document carrying a
> task-table heading.
>
> `PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md §3` C7 allows exactly one task table, in `docs/PLAN.md`. This
> file is what `docs/claude/PLAN.md` was — a stale snapshot with its own task table, which
> made it a second claimant to rank 3 of `§0`. `RepoGuardTest` copies it into the tree,
> asserts the guard reports it, and removes it again; the guard's real scan lists TRACKED
> markdown, and this file is tracked as `.fixture`, not as `.md`, so it is invisible to it.
>
> The `.fixture` suffix is load-bearing for exactly that reason.

**Version:** 2.9 · **Backend:** Laravel 13 (O1)

